Performing evaluation, analysis and makes recommendations regarding tool usage and selection;
Designing and developing test tools that allow teams to scale out to support new features;
Providing technical direction and support to team members in multiple geographic locations on testing approach and all aspects of automation testing to ensure industry standards and best practices are followed;
Utilizing tools and methodologies to improve individual team effectiveness and to increase efficiencies in the QA process; and,
Establishing test data management strategies and implementing them for different testing.
