Strong hands-on technical/analytical skills, with experience in statistical analysis to support decision making;
Ability to lead and oversee multiple projects in parallel, with proven project management and time leadership skills;
Results oriented, with experience in aligning team and individual level goals to the broader vision of the organization;
A creative and flexible approach to problem-solving, coupled with an experimental posture, to challenge past assumptions and promote new ways of thinking;
Excellent written and verbal communication skills, allowing you to accurately communicate business needs and requirements and to advocate on behalf of your team;
Up-to-date knowledge of financial markets, and how Bloomberg products deliver value to our clients.
