Data Analytics Technology Consultant
to join its national and collaborative Digital Solutions team. This individual will play a key role in developing and implementing a business plan to expand Langan’s already robust data management and analytics work. This individual will help develop and grow Langan’s external analytics practice and build the Langan brand.
Job Responsibilities
Develop and execute strategies to grow Langan’s Data Management and Analytics practice;
